<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Solution 2 - Technical Design Document (TDD)</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #1e293b; margin: 40px; }
  h1 { color: #0f172a; border-bottom: 3px solid #2563eb; padding-bottom: 8px; font-size: 24pt; }
  h2 { color: #1e40af; border-bottom: 1.5px solid #93c5fd; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 26px; font-size: 16pt; }
  h3 { color: #1e3a8a; margin-top: 18px; font-size: 13pt; }
  p, li { font-size: 11pt; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 16px 0; font-size: 10pt; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px 10px; text-align: left; }
  th { background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0f172a; font-weight: bold; }
  tr:nth-child(even) { background-color: #f8fafc; }
  .callout { background: #eff6ff; border-left: 4px solid #2563eb; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 16px 0; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; font-size: 11pt; }
  code { background: #f1f5f9; color: #b91c1c; padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: Consolas, monospace; }
  pre { background: #0f172a; color: #f8fafc; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: Consolas, monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>Solution 2: Technical Design Document (TDD)</h1>
<div class="callout">
  <b>Project:</b> CapacityConnect — Digital Capacity Building & Competency Governance Portal<br>
  <b>Role:</b> Solution Architect (Acting under evaluation guidelines)<br>
  <b>Required Sections:</b> Chosen Tech Stack, Comprehensive Database Schemas, and Complete JSON API Contracts.
</div>

<h2>1. Chosen Technology Stack & Justification</h2>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Layer</th>
      <th>Technology</th>
      <th>Architectural Justification</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><b>Frontend</b></td>
      <td>React 18 + Vite + Tailwind CSS</td>
      <td>Lightning-fast Single Page Application (SPA), responsive UI, modular component architecture, and sub-2 second bundle load.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><b>Backend API</b></td>
      <td>Node.js + Express.js</td>
      <td>Event-driven non-blocking I/O for heavy concurrent requests, Excel bulk ingestion, and robust middleware pipelines.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><b>Database</b></td>
      <td>MongoDB Atlas + Mongoose</td>
      <td>Flexible document store for nested course modules, quiz question banks, and rapid horizontal scaling.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><b>Security & Auth</b></td>
      <td>JWT + Bcrypt.js + Helmet</td>
      <td>Stateless Bearer token authentication, 10-round salted password hashing, and HTTP security header hardening.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><b>Testing</b></td>
      <td>Playwright E2E Suite</td>
      <td>Cross-browser automated test coverage for multi-role workflows, tenant isolation, and QR verification.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>2. Complete Database Schemas (Data Models)</h2>

<h3>2.1 User Entity Schema (<code>models/User.js</code>)</h3>
<pre>
{
  fullName: String (required),
  email: String (required, unique, indexed),
  passwordHash: String (required),
  role: Enum ['platform_super_admin', 'institute_admin', 'trainer', 'trainee'],
  organizationId: ObjectId (ref 'Organization', indexed),
  department: String,
  enrollmentId: String (sparse indexed),
  competencies: [{ competencyName: String, score: Number, lastEvaluated: Date }]
}
</pre>

<h3>2.2 Organization / Tenant Schema (<code>models/Organization.js</code>)</h3>
<pre>
{
  name: String (required),
  code: String (required, unique, uppercase), // e.g. 'IITM-PUNE'
  type: Enum ['university', 'research_institute', 'regional_center', 'ministry_hq'],
  location: { city: String, state: String, country: String },
  isActive: Boolean (default true)
}
</pre>

<h3>2.3 Course & Module Schema (<code>models/Course.js</code>)</h3>
<pre>
{
  title: String (required),
  courseCode: String (unique),
  organizationId: ObjectId (ref 'Organization', indexed),
  trainerId: ObjectId (ref 'User', indexed),
  modules: [{ moduleNumber: Number, title: String, contentType: String, contentUrl: String }],
  targetedCompetencies: [String]
}
</pre>

<h3>2.4 Assessment & Anti-Cheat Schema (<code>models/Assessment.js</code>)</h3>
<pre>
{
  courseId: ObjectId (ref 'Course', indexed),
  title: String,
  timeLimitMinutes: Number,
  passPercentage: Number,
  antiCheatConfig: { maxTabSwitchesAllowed: Number, lockdownMode: Boolean },
  questions: [{ questionId: String, questionText: String, options: [String], correctOptionIndex: Number (select: false) }]
}
</pre>

<h3>2.5 Certificate & Cryptographic QR Schema (<code>models/Certificate.js</code>)</h3>
<pre>
{
  certificateNumber: String (unique, indexed),
  traineeId: ObjectId (ref 'User'),
  traineeName: String,
  courseTitle: String,
  organizationName: String,
  issueDate: Date,
  verificationHash: String (SHA-256 unique),
  qrCodeUrl: String
}
</pre>

<h2>3. RESTful API Endpoints & JSON Contracts</h2>

<h3>3.1 Authentication: <code>POST /api/auth/login</code></h3>
<p><b>Request Body:</b></p>
<pre>
{
  "email": "trainer.sharma@iitm.ac.in",
  "password": "Password@123"
}
</pre>
<p><b>Response Body (200 OK):</b></p>
<pre>
{
  "success": true,
  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...",
  "user": {
    "id": "65b10acd12a34f001b987a01",
    "fullName": "Dr. Rajesh Sharma",
    "role": "trainer",
    "organizationId": "65b10a2212a34f001b987999"
  }
}
</pre>

<h3>3.2 AI Trainer Matching: <code>POST /api/trainer-matching/recommend</code></h3>
<p><b>Request Body:</b></p>
<pre>
{
  "courseTitle": "Atmospheric Radar Systems",
  "requiredCompetencies": ["Radar Meteorology", "Signal Processing"],
  "targetOrganizationId": "65b10a2212a34f001b987999"
}
</pre>
<p><b>Response Body (200 OK):</b></p>
<pre>
{
  "success": true,
  "recommendations": [
    {
      "trainerId": "65b10acd12a34f001b987a01",
      "fullName": "Dr. Rajesh Sharma",
      "matchScore": 94.5,
      "breakdown": { "skillOverlap": 40.0, "experience": 23.5, "feedback": 18.0, "availability": 13.0 }
    }
  ]
}
</pre>

<h3>3.3 Public QR Verification: <code>GET /api/certificates/verify/:certificateNumber</code></h3>
<p><b>Response Body (200 OK):</b></p>
<pre>
{
  "status": "AUTHENTIC",
  "verified": true,
  "certificate": {
    "certificateNumber": "CERT-2026-88319",
    "traineeName": "Priya V. Nair",
    "courseTitle": "Doppler Weather Radar Interpretation",
    "issuingInstitute": "IITM Pune",
    "finalScore": "92%",
    "verificationHash": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855"
  }
}
</pre>

</body>
</html>
